WEBVTT

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.600
It may be possible to attain heaven.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.350
Can you be more specific?

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.810
I've recorded it in a notebook.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.230
However,

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:29.020
before I learned of his methods…

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.740
I laid in wait for over two decades

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.780
to gain access to Jotaro Kujo's memory.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.410
The contents of the notebook
are within his memory.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:44.790
The murderer had planned to steal
my father's Stand by giving it form.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:45.830
That's his ability.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.130
My dad's not dead.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:51.760
If I get his Stand back,
he will come back to life.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:55.590
I won.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.260
Don't underestimate me, bitch!

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.260
Nothing has changed.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:04.020
Even with Star Platinum,
your father is still a living mummy!

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.560
The User has my father's memory disc.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.980
Now's my chance to find its User!

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:19.950
There's something I want you
to try doing to it.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:23.040
Is that a human bone?

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.500
Whose is it?

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.750
It doesn't concern you.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.960
Let's just say that it belongs to
an old friend of mine.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.920
My dear friend,

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.920
Dio's bone.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:07.970
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (2)

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.890
Damn, it got my leg.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.810
Ermes, just what is happening here?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.520
-Is this a Stand attack?
-That's right.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.400
Run! It's charging towards you!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.160
It's already on the move!

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.660
Stone Ocean!

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.750
Jolyne!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.980
So this is a Stand ability.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:57.520
He must have gotten a disc
from Pale Snake.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.280
This must mean…

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.490
I see now.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.280
Jolyne, take F.F. and get out of here.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.700
This is my problem.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.700
You stay out of it.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.790
No, Ermes.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.330
This isn't just your problem anymore.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.170
Sports Maximum must be after something.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:21.800
Most likely, it's related to
my father's stolen memory.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:25.220
He is trying to find something
within these prison walls.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.390
And we can learn what he's plotting

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:31.720
by reading the disc
inside Sports Maximum's head.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:35.560
Jolyne, focus on
escaping this corridor for now.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:39.770
He has got to be close
to drowning in that pipe.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.780
If we can hold out until then,
his ability will disappear.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.240
-Something's off.
-What?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:46.820
Where is it?

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.200
The invisible stuffed alligator.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.450
If it moves, the threads should vibrate

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.210
and show me its location.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:04.840
It's on the wall!

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.260
The hell?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.930
Shit, an invisible corpse
has no concept of up and down.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.060
It can travel on the floor or the walls!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:15.480
Stop!

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.690
I'm the one you want, bastard!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.360
You're wrong, Ermes.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.780
He's no longer just an enemy of you two.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:26.950
This bastard bit off my left leg.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.450
Where is my leg now?

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.910
In its stomach?

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.750
So this asshole is my enemy too.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.660
Stay back, F.F.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.250
We don't know where it is.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.040
It'll take a bite out of you!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.420
Stop, F.F.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.090
You're right.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.680
It'll bite me.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.760
That's all these corpses can do.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.770
But it's fine.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:56.680
I got my hand inside its mouth.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.610
We did it.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.410
I felt it going down.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.580
Isn't this a part of your mauled shoulder?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.290
Dammit, it may not be big enough
to patch up.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.800
He chomped your shoulder to pieces.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.550
Here, F.F.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.680
Oh, thanks.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:33.050
-Ermes, come closer.
-Yeah?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.520
Ermes, am I correct

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:48.360
that we were attacked by
an alligator-like ghost?

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.780
Sports Maximum controls these ghosts.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.740
No, I don't think that's right.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.490
It was way too vicious.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.790
It wasn't a ghost,
but an invisible corpse.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:06:59.910
What?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.420
A living dead that hunts for blood
by instinct.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.090
Sports Maximum's ability
can create invisible zombies.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.680
The pipe!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.140
What is it now, Ermes?

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.430
What happened to Sports Maximum?

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.220
Did he drown to death?

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:18.980
I can't tell.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.600
It's too dark for me to see.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.020
He may be lodged deeper in the pipe.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.650
Or, maybe he…

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.230
These handprints…

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.450
Fuck…

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.750
My throat is coated with shitty water.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.420
I want to rinse my mouth, dammit.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.420
What was I about to do?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.800
Where was I trying to go?

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.260
Oh, I remember it now.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:54.640
The chapel…

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.720
I'm headed to the chapel.

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.310
My mission…

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:03.060
is to find that piece of bone.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.940
If you fail, surely you understand

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:11.150
that the ability I bestowed
will no longer be yours.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.360
I know it.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.450
My ability, Limp Viscuit,
can find that bone.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:19.660
The bone Pale Snake ordered me to find.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.750
I can find it.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.290
Dammit.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.210
I sure could use a break before I start.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:31.380
Like a good scrubbing
and something to drink.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.800
Something refreshing.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.390
That woman there…

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:40.890
Perfect timing.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:45.020
She's a bitch type… What was her name?

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.810
I can't recall it.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.610
I'll just call her a bitch.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.320
Damn.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:56.490
Won't even greet me
though I'm bribing him.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.990
Hey, how's it going?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.330
Are you on duty?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:04.250
I could use a drink.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.420
You want to go to the cafe with me?

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:11.300
Afterward, we can have a little fun
in a corner in some room.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.630
We can rub each other's bodies all over.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:22.180
Asshole, how dare you touch me?

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:25.640
You touched me. You better pay up first!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.440
What are you talking about?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:28.900
Little shit.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:32.150
How dare he touch you
when he hasn't even paid?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:37.740
What the…

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.320
Dammit.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:41.830
Where did Sports Maximum go off to?

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:47.620
He must have escaped that pipe
while we were dealing with the alligator.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:49.330
Or…

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:53.050
Maybe he has already
turned into an invisible corpse.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.800
That was just a little kick.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.800
Stop fooling around!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:59.590
Fooling around?

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:02.310
He looks down on you once
and it's over for you, bitch.

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:05.020
Do whatever it takes to make him pay up.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.230
Lend me a hand, and let's find his cash.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.270
Are you listening? Come on, help me.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.190
He's got something on his sleeves.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.360
What's this?

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.030
Oh, so you will pay me?

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.160
Why didn't you say that first?

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:24.950
That's what I just said.
Listen closely, idiot.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:31.250
What else can he be hiding?
What about here inside his mouth?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.720
Hold on, you want to do it
right now, right here?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.340
I don't get it.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:41.300
What is it that you want to do?

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:44.850
Come on, stop fooling around.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:48.270
I don't do that kinky stuff.

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:56.860
I'll be taking this.
You had something nice, after all.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.410
What the hell is this?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.540
This isn't a drug.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.620
It's seeping out of my skin.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.540
This smell…

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:15.800
It's sewage!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.300
It's the stench of sewage!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.930
My body…

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:24.470
The filthy water seeping out of
my body reeks of…

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:28.060
Fuck! No, I can't already be…

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.350
The hell?

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.190
It's flowing from midair.
The fuck's going on?

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:50.540
I didn't want anything to drink
in the first place.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.080
I wanted to devour something!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.920
I wanted to devour
and satisfy this craving!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.250
Yes, the brains!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.130
I remember it now.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.550
I drowned to death in that pipe.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.350
Shit! She did this to me!

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.770
That younger sister of Gloria Costello!

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:13.140
That bitch, how dare she do this to me?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.230
How dare she!

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.070
I thirst!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.700
Ermes, look over there.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.830
Oh, my.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.870
Be careful. He's out of the pipe
just as I thought.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:36.540
How did he do this to her?

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.040
Did he bite her to death?

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.710
Are human teeth capable
of such a vicious attack?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.010
Can they destroy a human body like this?

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:48.470
He's no longer human,
neither in intelligence nor morals.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:52.520
But Pale Snake's disc is
with this man, without a doubt.

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:54.980
I'll do whatever it takes
to get that disc.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.690
Jolyne, you wait outside.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.400
Damn, he slipped out.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.780
Don't leave my side, Ermes.

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:09.450
We're trapped in!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.160
He is capable of thinking
just like a human!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.160
Stay away from the wall!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.790
We already know that
he's not confined to the floor!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.630
We'll track his location
three-dimensionally!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.090
There you are!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.390
You chose to hang from the ceiling.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.970
Sounds like I crushed some bones.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:39.520
Grabbing with his broken wrist?
Right, he's already a corpse.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.610
Stone Ocean!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.490
He's caught!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.280
No.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:53.830
Jolyne!

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.910
That's not Sports Maximum!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.710
He's using
the dead woman's body as a decoy!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:04.380
Jolyne!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.970
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT
STAND MASTER: SPORTS MAXIMUM

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.010
Jolyne!

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:22.400
Where? Where the hell are you, fucker?

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.650
Jolyne.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.110
Don't move anymore, Jolyne.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.700
He's not your enemy.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.370
This is between me and Sports Maximum.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.370
Like I said, Ermes.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.870
This goes beyond

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:41.290
your personal desire for revenge.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.340
No, not even beyond.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:49.550
We are already out of time
and energy to even plan.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:50.470
Look over there.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.470
-He can't be…
-He's had us…

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:01.940
cornered the entire time.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.900
He has already revived them.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.900
The invisible undead.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.200
Who knows how many are lurking and where.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.530
We're surrounded, Ermes.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.870
Let's turn back for now.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.870
Staying alive is our priority.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.290
We must open that door
so that we can escape.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.540
I'll extend the thread
as much as possible to get F.F.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:24.790
We'll retreat for now.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.250
Retrieving the disc

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.460
and getting your revenge can wait.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:33.890
Ermes!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:35.640
Revenge…

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.480
That's what's important here, Jolyne.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.730
Revenge matters most
even to Sports Maximum,

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:45.860
who is lurking somewhere in this room.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:49.650
He wants to get revenge for
being drowned to death.

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:53.200
He must be overcome by
vengeance right now.

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:59.080
He wants to maul me to death
and fill his mouth with blood.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:03.170
-What are you--
-Sports Maximum will make sure

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.920
-that he's the one who kills me.
-Ermes.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:07.960
Listen, Jolyne.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:12.300
Some people will say getting even
won't bring my sister back.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.970
As if they know what I went through.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.640
And others tell me
forgiveness is important.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.520
Gloria!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:21.980
Bullshit.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.270
Forcing myself to forget how it feels

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:28.820
to have family thrown
in the gutter and live on?

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.940
I refuse to live like that,

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.660
and I've braced myself for this moment.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:41.000
Revenge is the way
to settle the score with my fate.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.460
No, Ermes.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.170
Fighting him to the death?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.460
Stop. Step back, Ermes.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.380
I'm reaching F.F. at this very moment.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.840
Five, no, seven of the undead

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.380
are severing my threads
and closing in on us!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.050
Don't do this, Ermes!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.350
Ermes!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:09.270
Which direction would he strike from?

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.450
My… consciousness…

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.080
Ermes…

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:28.130
She copied her head with her sticker!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.330
The seal of kiss…

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.340
is my license for revenge!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:35.050
I found you, Sports Maximum!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.100
I knew you'd try as much.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:44.310
Just like when you trapped me
in that pipe,

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:49.520
I knew you'd use that sticker
to copy an object.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:52.360
Your ability won't work against
me anymore.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:54.610
After all, I am…

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.700
already dead.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:00.240
Shit, it didn't work.

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.530
Where the hell is he?

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.910
You can't hear my voice, can you?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.750
But I'll say it anyway.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:12.380
It's your sister's fault
for witnessing what she shouldn't have.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.130
Er… mes…

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.680
Damn! Missed again!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.350
Because of your sister,

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.270
I fell into your hands,
and look at me now.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:33.520
I will never get over this feeling.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.730
Not this one.

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:35.980
Nor this one.

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:37.320
Listen up.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:41.120
Even if I eat your brains

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:47.450
and stuff the shit in your guts
into your emptied skull,

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.620
I will never get over what you did to me.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.550
It's over!

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.920
Now, I will finish you off!

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:05.850
Ermes was waiting for this exact moment!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:10.350
The moment he removes the sticker
so he can maul her head!

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.020
Remove the sticker,

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.020
and the copy fuses back to the original.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:18.150
Even if Sports Maximum
had swallowed the duplicate earlier!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.450
I know exactly where you are now!

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.370
Aim slightly above.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:26.830
The midsagittal plane of your face!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.130
She got him!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.710
Listen.

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.380
This kick is for Gloria.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:44.550
Sounds like the bones on your face
broke just now.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.640
Think of it as Gloria smashing your face.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.430
And this…

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.140
is also for Gloria!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.310
Make mincemeat out of this bitch!

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.900
You plan on hiding again.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.740
Well, you won't be able to.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.530
A sticker split your head in two.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:10.540
Remove this sticker,
and it returns to the original.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.580
The next hit is also for Gloria.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.880
And the one after that too.

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:23.130
And so is the next one!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.590
The next one too.

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.050
They are all for Gloria!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.510
This one,

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.560
and this one too!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.480
Take this!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.190
And this!

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:37.360
This, this, and this!

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.400
This, this, this, and this!

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:42.610
They're all for Gloria!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:15.560
I don't know why,
but tears started rolling down.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:22.280
I just want… to cry next to you.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:29.160
But I may not have that kind of time.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.160
F.F.!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.500
Where are you? Come heal her!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.500
Hurry!

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:39.250
Open this door.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.840
Hurry!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:43.010
SPORTS MAXIMUM
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT - ANNIHILATED

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:15.970
Emergency alarm,

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:18.480
Commons Area 1A, Mausoleum.

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:19.940
Stop right there!

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:21.020
What's going on here?

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:22.900
Don't move!

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:30.820
Prisoner FE40536.

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:33.280
Name, Jolyne Cujoh!

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:41.040
After reading that disc, I now understand.

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:45.210
I know what I must do in here now.

00:23:48.090 --> 00:23:48.960
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
